	<div class="widgetBody cpGrid cpGrid1 ">
		<div class="row wide">

					<div class="col col1">
						<ol class="semanticList layout2">
										<li class="megaMenuItem widgetItem" data-pageid="408" role="none">
				<div class="widgetTitle">
					<a href="/408/Advertising-Promotion-Commission" target="_self" >Advertising &amp; Promotion Commission</a>
				</div>
				<p class="widgetDesc">Founded in 2018, The Paragould Advertising &amp; Promotion Commission is responsible for the allocation of taxes collected from visitors who stay in hotels, motels, or bed and breakfasts within the city limits of Paragould.The tax is levied at 3% of the total costs of lodging for any given stay. </p>
				
			</li>			<li class="megaMenuItem widgetItem" data-pageid="212" role="none">
				<div class="widgetTitle">
					<a href="/212/Airport-Advisory-Board" target="_self" >Airport Advisory Board</a>
				</div>
				<p class="widgetDesc">Access information about the Airport Commission.</p>
				
			</li>			<li class="megaMenuItem widgetItem" data-pageid="217" role="none">
				<div class="widgetTitle">
					<a href="/217/ADA-Grievance-Compliance-Committee" target="_self" >ADA Grievance Compliance Committee</a>
				</div>
				<p class="widgetDesc">Learn more about the ADA Grievance Compliance Committee.</p>
				
			</li>			<li class="megaMenuItem widgetItem" data-pageid="213" role="none">
				<div class="widgetTitle">
					<a href="/213/City-Beautiful-Commission" target="_self" >City Beautiful Commission</a>
				</div>
				<p class="widgetDesc">Browse through information for the City Beautiful Commission.</p>
				
			</li>			<li class="megaMenuItem widgetItem" data-pageid="519" role="none">
				<div class="widgetTitle">
					<a href="/519/Downtown-Architectural-District-Review-B" target="_self" >Downtown Architectural District Review Board</a>
				</div>
				<p class="widgetDesc"></p>
				
			</li>			<li class="megaMenuItem widgetItem" data-pageid="524" role="none">
				<div class="widgetTitle">
					<a href="/524/Greene-Acres-Nursing-Home-Board-of-Direc" target="_self" >Greene Acres Nursing Home Board of Directors</a>
				</div>
				<p class="widgetDesc">The purpose of the Board of Directors is to establish policy and procedures for the corporation and the operation of its facilities; to authorize the officers of the corporation to act on behalf of the corporation; to borrow money and enter into agreements with lending institutions; to review and approve actions by committees established herein and ad hoc committees established by the Board; to elect officers; and to amend By-Laws. </p>
				
			</li>			<li class="megaMenuItem widgetItem" data-pageid="520" role="none">
				<div class="widgetTitle">
					<a href="/520/Land-Bank-Commission" target="_self" >Land Bank Commission</a>
				</div>
				<p class="widgetDesc">The City of Paragould Land Bank’s mission is to stabilize and revitalize abandoned properties to sustain and stimulate a more equitable and inclusive community. We will strive to acquire vacant and abandoned properties in an effort to reduce urban blight and return them to productive use, improve the health and safety of neighborhoods within the City of Paragould, and maximize the overall physical experience of residents and visitors beyond just our property inventory.</p>
				
			</li>			<li class="megaMenuItem widgetItem" data-pageid="518" role="none">
